WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.882
-Right!
-That's the Hugo we know!

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.092
Go!

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.226
He's a great athlete.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.644
Yeah.

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:21.438
The honest truth is,

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:26.818
I've thought about what it'd be like
if you never started metal boxing.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.403
But if you did box,

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:33.324
I wanted you to have a clean-fighting jock
like Hugo to be your opponent.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:40.123
Hugo versus Levius. If I were a fan,
that's what I'd want to see the most.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:43.543
Yeah, you're right, Uncle.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.879
Hugo's amazing.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.265
The steam tubes are cracked.
The valves are also breaking.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.559
And his Agartha water's nearly gone...

00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:02.604
Hugo, you've fought well.
You've pleased the fans―

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:06.232
Not yet. It can't end yet...

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.318
If you keep this up, your career―

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.402
Old man!

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:11.362
Please!

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:16.367
Next, the sixth round! The final round!

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:24.709
I've got to continue what Jones started.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.296
-What the...
-That stance?

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:30.590
Is he a kid, just learning to box?

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:32.717
Amazing...

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:37.514
Yeah, he's cut out the showiness,
but he's fighting to win.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.522
Boss! That's all he can take!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.334
The Cross Screw!

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:07.460
-Did he do it?!
-Hugo?

